{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "しおりちゃん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mob6hF3wM.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かわいすぎる"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂に加入する前からだいすき！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まっしろで可愛くてとんでもなく美人で、\n歌もダンスも演技も上手くて、\n超多彩なのにその上に誰よりも努力を重ねて自分の才能を磨き続けていて、\nかっこよくてお話ししてると超楽しくておもしろくて、\n話し方や言葉の紡ぎ方も素敵で。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "同い年ということで一緒にお仕事をさせていただくこともたくさんあったけれど、\nもうすごすぎて同じ24歳ということが信じられないよ〜。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "しおりちゃんは本当にすごい！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobxhLWVw.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そういうとしおりちゃんは、\nありがとう、はるかもすごいんだよ、って言っていっぱい褒めてくれる。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも、いっぱい褒めてくれるんです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私の知らない私の魅力を教えてくれて、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私はしおりちゃんが大好きだから\n「しおりちゃんが褒めてくれたから」という理由で自信を持ってました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobAuL8vi.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "タコパをしたりお散歩もしたり、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "卒コンが近い中でも\n餃子パーティを一緒にしてくれて餃子を作ってくれたり、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "しおりちゃんが私と仲良くなりたいって言ってくれたのが嬉しくて、\n一緒に過ごした時間一つ一つが全部宝物です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからもずっと\nしおりちゃんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "尊敬する先輩で、\n憧れの人で、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だいすきなお友達☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "寂しさに負けないように\n前を向いて頑張ります。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからもずっとしおりちゃんが大好きな\nこの乃木坂46を守っていけるように！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobjRNI3X.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "しおりと離れたくなさすぎる私↑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからのしおりちゃんの人生が\n最高に明るくて最高に幸せでありますように！！！！！✨❄️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だいすきー！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またあそぼうね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "賀喜遥香"}], "source": "official"}